{"id": "DgM8el2Te0m", "title": "Video by leogrundstrom", "description": "Comment \"HOOK\" to get my hook skill.\n\nClaude Code can now write proven viral hooks for your videos in seconds.\n\nSomeone just turned 500 hours of short-form research into one, and it teaches Claude how the best creators think about a hook instead of filling in a template.\n\nSo I just built my own in Claude Code, where I gave it the transcripts of 8 hours of the most watched hook videos on YouTube and told it to keep the principles behind each hook, not the steps.\n\nThen Anthropic's skill-creator turned all of that into one skill file, so I didn't have to edit anything.\n\nIt came back with 18 principles, like the two silent questions every viewer asks, which are what is this about and what do I get if I stay.\n\nAnd then I gave it one of my worst hooks, and it told me exactly why it flopped and rewrote it three different ways.\n\nAnd Claude loads the skill on its own whenever you write a script, so every hook you make starts from those 8 hours.\n\n#claude #claudecode #hooks #contentcreator #reelstips", "channel": "leogrundstrom", "uploader_id": "71015943272", "uploader": "Leo Grundström", "timestamp": 1795690748, "like_count": 201, "comment_count": 644, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-969855186002116a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.425, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQODsRNwbz0Nvo21zQKJq8lFdZ4yCV-8zL23NUG9Br1jlQvUvW-Ul70mzyq7alIKHOXiTKy3w6XSEuGDJ6BTD-vIjBC2VV-hlR8DpZQ.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=T-GoegUDP6sQ7kNvwHpaVsv&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ardJ0INfuSTFb4vufgJlCQ&_nc_ss=70789&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQU1gV0Ur6UfDIClQyKRH-K1CnefsS1wMyGR_UOu8kVksw&oe=6B0AF98B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "ht